00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,720
What's one of the skills you had to learn or a way you had to change in order to support your company as a group?

2
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,960
Well, I'll just start at the beginning.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:13,400
I had to be willing to have people who disagreed with my choice, including my colleagues, my friends and my family.

4
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:17,080
And so most people cannot get past one, two or three of those.

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,960
And so they just stay stuck.

6
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:25,960
So, I mean, the first thing you have to do is be willing to be disagreed with.

7
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:29,480
And I think you also need to be willing to look cringe

8
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:31,600
because you will be cringe because you've never done it before.

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,240
And so it is a prerequisite of doing something new that you will suck.

10
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,600
And so many people are afraid of sucking.

11
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:39,040
And as a result, they continue to lose because they never try.

12
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:43,920
Losers stay losers because they are afraid of losing.

13
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:44,600
So they never try.

